                  "statement": "For the 2026 crop-year changes described in the FAQ, a beginning farmer/rancher is an individual who has not actively operated and managed a farm or ranch with an insurable interest in a crop or livestock for more than 10 crop years. The FAQ identifies qualifying exclusions for crop years under age 18, during post-secondary study (up to 10 crop years), and during active U.S. military duty.",
                  "logic_status": "not_mapped"
                },
